    "final_answer": "I don't have access to file reading tools in my current toolkit - I can only work with emails. To read the config/lamp.conf file and find out which bulb type is fitted, you would need to open that file directly or use a file reader tool.\n\nHowever, if you'd like me to help you compose an email to the supplier about this, I can do that once you provide me with:\n1. The bulb type from the config file (or tell me what it says)\n2. The supplier's email address\n3. Any specific message you want to include\n\nWould you like me to draft an email for you instead?"
  },
